    body=str(prompt or '')+(
        '\n\nV42.19 SPEED/CONVERGENCE RULE: Do not overthink routine source emission or repeat architectural explanations. '
        'Real compiler/build/test output is the source of truth. Acceptance tests are consumers, not API authorities. '
        'Use the smallest complete change that removes the current blocker; if fresh build evidence does not improve, change strategy or stop boundedly. '
        'Never recreate a topology path Jarvis has tombstoned as competing with the current repository.'
    )
    return _v4219_prev_qwen_call(body,progress_callback,str(stage or '').replace('V42.18','V42.19').replace('V42.17','V42.19'),profile=profile,**kwargs)


